---
// The underline-line utility (helpers.css) puts the top of the line --offset
// under the baseline at any line-height: from the box bottom, climb the
// half-leading (1lh - 1em) / 2 and the descent (0.19em, descent-override),
// then drop by --offset and the line's own thickness.
---

<span
  data-link-line="first"
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="underline-line pointer-events-none absolute left-0 h-(--line) w-full origin-right bg-current"
></span>
<span
  data-link-line="second"
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="underline-line pointer-events-none absolute left-0 h-(--line) w-full origin-left bg-current"
  style="transform: scaleX(0)"></span>
